@startuml Anwendungskontext
left to right direction

actor "Forschender" as Researcher

rectangle "Test- und\nEvaluierungsumgebung" as EvalSystem

rectangle "AM-Modell /\nNLP-Pipeline" as Pipeline
rectangle "OHI-Datenbestand" as OHI
rectangle "Feedback-Datenbank" as Feedback

Researcher --> EvalSystem : analysiert\nInterviews

OHI --> EvalSystem : Interviewtexte

EvalSystem --> Pipeline : Klassifikation\nanfordern

Pipeline --> EvalSystem : TAP-Elemente

EvalSystem --> Feedback : Korrekturen\nspeichern

@enduml